  m_text: "Hello, it's me, Sean Simon. The Developer behind Fat Butters' Jetpack
    Ride.  I'm so happy that you're enjoying the game enough to go this deep into
    the settings menu. \n\nI made this game to help support my family. One way that
    you can help me do that is to keep ads enabled. They are optional, but I would
    appreciate you leaving them on.\n\nAs a gesture of my appreciation, every category
    of ad you enable will increase the number of bones you get."
